offecho.echo ==========================================echo   Setting up CT20 Mobile App (Phase 1)echo ==========================================echo.REM 1. Create public folderif not exist "public" mkdir publicecho [1/4] Created 'public' folder.REM 2. Create manifest.json(echo {echo   "name": "CT20 Assembly Tracker",echo   "short_name": "CT20",echo   "start_url": "/",echo   "display": "standalone",echo   "background_color": "#ffffff",echo   "theme_color": "#6d4aff",echo   "orientation": "portrait-primary",echo   "icons": [echo     {echo       "src": "icon-192.png",echo       "sizes": "192x192",echo       "type": "image/png"echo     },echo     {echo       "src": "icon-512.png",echo       "sizes": "512x512",echo       "type": "image/png"echo     }echo   ]echo })  [2/4] Created 'manifest.json'.REM 3. Create dummy icon files (1x1 pixel PNG)REM We create a tiny valid PNG so the app doesn't crash. REM Later you can replace these with real icons.echo iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg== 
